{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10101010","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10101010","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1010101001:0":{"text":"お待ちください牧師様！どうか私を助けてください！","source_cn":"牧师大人！您别走……您可一定得救救我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A0BE6EE2745C23F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1010101002:0":{"text":"恐れる必要はありません、デューラ様が見守っておられます。\nさあ、あなたの悩みを教えてください。","source_cn":"艾雅在上，无需恐惧。\\n请说吧，你遇到什么麻烦了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B336804DF8B3A84","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1010101003:0":{"text":"私は、金麦村の南村の者です。\nこれから言うことはどうか内密に……でもどうか助けてほしいのです！","source_cn":"我从金穗村的南村来。\\n牧师大人……请您一定救我，为我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4CD5B8EDA7ECFF4F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1010101004:0":{"text":"ちょうどブドウの収穫時期で、みんな忙しくしていて……\nうちの子供がブドウを一房食べてしまったことに気付かなかったんです。","source_cn":"葡萄熟了，大家都忙着收摘。\\n我家小孩淘气……偷吃了一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA49848B641A79C9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1010101005:0":{"text":"フランツ様からは、一粒でも減ったら容赦しないと言われていて……","source_cn":"弗朗茨老爷明明吩咐过，少一颗葡萄都要找我们算账！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC004FDFEA75977FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1010101006:0":{"text":"でも、一房だけなら、ごまかせると思ってました……\nですが、そんな卑しい考えを女神様に見抜かれ、神罰が下ったのです！","source_cn":"但我寻思，一串而已，瞒得过去……\\n可我这种卑鄙的想法...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x836EC1CE50D2EBCF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1010101007:0":{"text":"ブドウを食べたうちの子は夜になると、家の中で化け物が跳ね回っていると、うわごとを言うようになったんです！","source_cn":"我那孩子吃了葡萄，到了晚上就开始胡言乱语，说家里到处有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F3E91640D97C14D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1010101008:0":{"text":"牧師様！どうか女神様に代わって私の罪をお許しください！我が子を元に戻してください！","source_cn":"牧师大人！请您代表女神宽恕我的罪！让我家孩子恢复正常吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x64E51B6DEDEDA1B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1010101009:0":{"text":"私が思うに、このことはフランツ様に打ち明けた方がいいかと……","source_cn":"我想，你应该直接向弗朗茨老爷坦白。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB419DFDE2FA0F0B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1010101010:0":{"text":"いいえ！だめです！そんなことはできません！\n女神様なら許してくれますが、フランツ様は私を女神様の元に送りかねません！！","source_cn":"不，牧师大人！我不能那么做！\\n女神会宽恕我，而弗朗茨...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB471497E4EFA491","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","v